&lt;h3 id="a-48-year-old-woman-going-downstairs-missed-a-step-and-tumbled-all-the-way-down"&gt;&lt;code&gt;A 48-year-old woman, going downstairs, missed a step and tumbled all the way down.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 id="one-simple-sentence-and-yet-it-was-the-start-of-her-tragic-story"&gt;One simple sentence, and yet it was the start of her tragic story.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Altered consciousness, plus trauma. The patient was wheeled into the resus room.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We put her on the ECG monitor, saw her heart was beating very fast, and right away got a 12 lead ECG&lt;/p&gt;
